OK sorry for making a mess here - I think the actual bug is just that objects with `__get_pydantic_core_schema__`  when used as an annotation in `__pydantic_extra__` don't have their serializers correctly evaluated as they are when used as regular fields - so i need to additionally define `__pydantic_serializer__` manually rather than having pydantic evaluate it when it's defined in `__get_pydantic_core_schema__`
